# ~/.koad-io/harness — framework loading layer (core / kindergarten segment).
#
# This directory is TRACKED framework content: startup.sh (context assembly) and
# the role primers that ~/.koad-io/commands/harness/* consume. It does not
# relocate — see HARNESS_LOCATION in commands/harness/pi/command.sh.
#
# Only runtime artifacts are ignored. They are written here at session time and
# are per-machine state, never framework content.
#
# Divergence note: hooks/ and bin/ use a default-deny allowlist (`*` + `!lines`).
# This segment uses a denylist instead, per koad 2026-09-22 — the loading layer is
# fixed framework content, so new files here are meant to ship by default.

# Bond-gate audit trail (extension/bond-gate/types.ts DEBUG_LOG)
bond-gate.log

# Extension load + runtime errors (extension/live-prompt.ts fallback when
# KOAD_IO_HARNESS_LOCATION is unset)
debug.log

# Any other per-session log
*.log
